OL,3,GNEWSACouncil chief fears over authority
OL,4,Afunding gaps
OL,5,
OL,6,FYears of underfunding from central
OL,7,Fgovernment means local authority
OL,8,Ffinances are close to collapsing, a
OL,9,Fcouncil boss has said.
OL,11,FA BBC Shared Data Unit investigation
OL,12,Frevealed Cumbria's two councils are
OL,13,Famong those planning the highest budget
OL,14,Fsavings in England, according to BBC
OL,15,Fanalysis.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
