OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil chief fears over authority
OL,4,Afunding gaps
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat-led Westmorland and
OL,7,FFurness Council is in sixth position
OL,8,Fnationally, with savings needed of #134
OL,9,Fper resident, while Labour-run
OL,10,FCumberland sits in 10th with #115.
OL,11,FWarrington came out on top with #186
OL,12,Fper head.
OL,14,FWestmorland and Furness' cabinet member
OL,15,Ffor finance Andrew Jarvis said it was a
OL,16,F"crisis of funding" for the authority.
OL,17,FThe government said it had made #78bn
OL,18,Favailable to councils this year.
